full_text:
Transition from `QuayEcosystem` to `QuayRegistry`

As a deployer with an existing {{QuayEcosystem}}, I want to transition to a {{QuayRegistry}} with minimal interaction in order to take advantage of new Quay Operator features.
Acceptance criteria:
- all managed components are migrated to {{QuayRegistry}}
- all externally managed components continued to be treated external when migrated to {{QuayRegistry}}
- no extended service downtime outside of Kubernetes load balancing / health check timeouts
